WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.810
What happens when you place a large rock in
SCP-914?

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.440
Researcher Jane Cho selected one large granite
rock for testing.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:13.219
She placed it into the Clockworks on the setting
"Fine," and the output produced was an object

00:00:13.219 --> 00:00:18.370
consisting of two quartz wheels attached to
a rectangular stone base.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:22.180
It was capable of independent movement, though
not sentient.

